  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "For conversion of compound <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>, the rate constant of the reaction was found to be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Lmol</mi><mmultiscripts><mo>&#160;</mo><mprescripts/><none/><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The order of the reaction is _____ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Rate(r)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>rate</mi><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup></mfrac></math></p><p>Unit of rate constant is&nbsp;related to order of reaction<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;by the relation:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>conc</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi>time</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Thus,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right\"><mtr><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><msup><mi>Lmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p>",
